<title>USA: Vinik group has 5.9 pct USFreightways stake.</title>
<headline>Vinik group has 5.9 pct USFreightways stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by former Magellan Fund manager Jeffrey Vinik said Thursday it has acquired a 5.9 percent stake, or 1,334,600 common shares, of USFreightways.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it paid $32.9 million for the stake and holds it for investment.</p>
<p>It said it bought the stake in the Rosemont, Ill.,-based company between November 1 and January 8 at  prices ranging from $21.4583 to $27.44 a share.</p>
</text>
